{"reviewId": "212069983_8avhMYFKA", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "盛世石油，乱世黄金。\n\n盛世石油：石油的定价权在“需求”。 经济繁荣时，工厂全力开工、贸易兴盛，需要消耗天量能源。这种由实体经济产生的、看得见摸得着的强劲需求，直接推高油价，因而金油比更低。\n\n乱世黄金：黄金的定价权在“恐惧”。 乱世中，法定货币因超发而贬值，其他资产剧烈波动，人们对整个金融体系的信任降到冰点。黄金作为跨越千年的“终极货币”，成了恐惧唯一的避难所，其价值由市场参与者的集体不安全感来定价，因而金油比更高。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "但康波认为，价格的波动当以黄金的购买力来衡量。如果用黄金原油价格比率来间接解释价格的波动，我们可以发现，黄金原油价格比率一直围绕着中枢波动", "range": "8654-8723", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "212069983_8avhMYFKA", "userVid": 212069983, "topics": [], "createTime": 1783714096, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 212069983, "name": "無早", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0012-hNs23zFHZsWhg4_mzyYr110/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "無早", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 17, "likes": [{"userVid": 53722581, "name": "心灵捕手", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM6kOuk0wsXDlR51GWnUl0DKYD4tC4yCdtyXdS0bYKAQKA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "心灵捕手", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "爱运动", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M11-0-5", "desc": "点评书籍", "title": "点评书籍", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "黄金的锚，在美金", "reviewId": "212069983_8avhMYFKA", "commentId": "212069